      "narration_text": "The grid is the audit. Now iterate: ask Claude to add a specificity sweep — hold sensitivity at ninety percent, vary specificity from point-seven to point-nine-nine, and show at what specificity the PPV at two-percent prevalence finally crosses the ten-percent threshold.",
